Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 04:50:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Add cursor-api-key config support (auth synthesis + JWT
 exchange)

The production gateway authenticates to Cursor with a user API key
(cursor-api-key in config.yaml) that is exchanged for short-lived Agent
Connect JWTs via /auth/exchange_user_api_key. The branch only supported
file-based OAuth cursor auths, so the config entry registered no clients
and every request failed with 'unknown provider for model'.

- config: CursorKey entries under cursor-api-key
- synthesizer: cursor:apikey auth entries carrying the key as attribute
- model registration: exchange the key eagerly so the live AvailableModels
  catalog (grok-4.5 etc.) registers instead of the builtin fallback
- executor: keep the exchanged JWT fresh, re-exchanging before expiry

Co-authored-by: Apologetic2022 <Apologetic2022@users.noreply.github.com>
